* {{audio|en-us-judicial.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ɪʃəl|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Of or relating to a [[court]] of [[law]], or to the [[administration]] of [[justice]].
#* {{quote-magazine|date=2013-08-10|volume=408|issue=8848|magazine={{w|The Economist}}
